{"route":"/docs/5.2/helpers/clearfix/","version":"5.2","renderedVersion":"5.2","title":{"id":"content","type":"heading","en":"Clearfix","level":1},"lead":{"id":"content--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Quickly and easily clear floated content within a container by adding a clearfix utility."},"blocks":[{"id":"content--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":"Easily clear <code>float</code>s by adding <code>.clearfix</code> <strong>to the parent element</strong>. Can also be used as a mixin."},{"id":"content--paragraph-3","type":"paragraph","en":"Use in HTML:"},{"id":"content--code-1","type":"code","value":"<div class=\"clearfix\">...</div>","language":"html"},{"id":"content--paragraph-4","type":"paragraph","en":"The mixin source code:"},{"id":"content--code-2","type":"code","value":"@mixin clearfix() {\n  &::after {\n    display: block;\n    clear: both;\n    content: \"\";\n  }\n}","language":"scss"},{"id":"content--paragraph-5","type":"paragraph","en":"Use the mixin in SCSS:"},{"id":"content--code-3","type":"code","value":".element {\n  @include clearfix;\n}","language":"scss"},{"id":"content--paragraph-6","type":"paragraph","en":"The following example shows how the clearfix can be used. Without the clearfix the wrapping div would not span around the buttons which would cause a broken layout."},{"id":"content--example-1","type":"demo","key":"f5f7e05d68354c0a1e07","height":147},{"id":"content--code-4","type":"code","value":"<div class=\"bg-info clearfix\">\n  <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-secondary float-start\">Example Button floated left</button>\n  <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-secondary float-end\">Example Button floated right</button>\n</div>","language":"html"}],"demos":[{"key":"f5f7e05d68354c0a1e07","html":"\n<div class=\"bg-info clearfix\">\n  <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-secondary float-start\">Example Button floated left</button>\n  <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-secondary float-end\">Example Button floated right